1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,732
Pac-Man punya ujung.

2
00:00:01,752 --> 00:00:03,079
Di level dua ratus lima puluh

3
00:00:03,099 --> 00:00:05,416
enam, separuh layarnya hancur,

4
00:00:05,436 --> 00:00:06,407
dan levelnya tidak bisa

5
00:00:06,427 --> 00:00:07,279
diselesaikan.

6
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:10,098
Pac-Man rilis tahun 1980.

7
00:00:10,118 --> 00:00:11,339
Makan semua titik,

8
00:00:11,359 --> 00:00:13,002
hindari empat hantu,

9
00:00:13,022 --> 00:00:14,167
lalu naik level.

10
00:00:14,187 --> 00:00:15,127
Di bawah layar,

11
00:00:15,147 --> 00:00:16,304
ikon buah menunjukkan level

12
00:00:16,324 --> 00:00:17,151
kamu.

13
00:00:17,171 --> 00:00:18,529
Komputer menyimpan angka dalam

14
00:00:18,549 --> 00:00:19,032
bit.

15
00:00:19,052 --> 00:00:19,961
Delapan bit,

16
00:00:19,981 --> 00:00:21,259
atau satu byte,

17
00:00:21,279 --> 00:00:22,698
cuma bisa menampung dua ratus

18
00:00:22,718 --> 00:00:23,689
lima puluh enam nilai,

19
00:00:23,709 --> 00:00:25,314
dari nol sampai dua ratus lima

20
00:00:25,334 --> 00:00:25,903
puluh lima.

21
00:00:25,923 --> 00:00:26,924
Lewat dari itu,

22
00:00:26,944 --> 00:00:28,658
angkanya kembali ke nol.

23
00:00:28,678 --> 00:00:30,842
Namanya integer overflow.

24
00:00:30,862 --> 00:00:32,251
Biasanya game cuma menggambar

25
00:00:32,271 --> 00:00:33,513
paling banyak tujuh buah.

26
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,432
Tapi di level dua ratus lima

27
00:00:35,452 --> 00:00:36,322
puluh enam,

28
00:00:36,342 --> 00:00:37,458
hitungannya meluap,

29
00:00:37,478 --> 00:00:39,502
dan program mencoba menggambar

30
00:00:39,522 --> 00:00:40,462
dua ratus lima puluh enam

31
00:00:40,482 --> 00:00:41,051
buah.

32
00:00:41,071 --> 00:00:42,072
Gambarnya meluber,

33
00:00:42,092 --> 00:00:43,156
menimpa sisi kanan labirin

34
00:00:43,176 --> 00:00:44,074
dengan simbol acak.

35
00:00:44,094 --> 00:00:45,563
Titik di sisi yang rusak tidak

36
00:00:45,583 --> 00:00:46,538
bisa dimakan semua,

37
00:00:46,558 --> 00:00:48,773
jadi level itu tidak pernah

38
00:00:48,793 --> 00:00:49,284
selesai.

39
00:00:49,304 --> 00:00:50,337
Para pemain menyebutnya kill

40
00:00:50,357 --> 00:00:51,077
screen.

41
00:00:51,097 --> 00:00:52,547
Skor sempurnanya tiga juta

42
00:00:52,567 --> 00:00:53,584
tiga ratus tiga puluh tiga

43
00:00:53,604 --> 00:00:54,947
ribu tiga ratus enam puluh,

44
00:00:54,967 --> 00:00:56,077
tanpa mati sekali pun.

45
00:00:56,097 --> 00:00:57,696
Billy Mitchell disebut sebagai

46
00:00:57,716 --> 00:00:59,043
orang pertama yang mencapainya

47
00:00:59,063 --> 00:01:00,068
dengan saksi,

48
00:01:00,088 --> 00:01:01,896
tahun 1999.

49
00:01:01,916 --> 00:01:04,296
Lucunya, tahun 1982,

50
00:01:04,316 --> 00:01:05,317
anak delapan tahun bernama

51
00:01:05,337 --> 00:01:06,571
Jeffrey Yee mendapat surat

52
00:01:06,591 --> 00:01:08,321
dari Presiden Ronald Reagan,

53
00:01:08,341 --> 00:01:09,605
untuk skor lebih dari enam

54
00:01:09,625 --> 00:01:10,231
juta.

55
00:01:10,251 --> 00:01:11,346
Skor itu hanya mungkin kalau

56
00:01:11,366 --> 00:01:12,971
dia melewati level dua ratus

57
00:01:12,991 --> 00:01:13,923
lima puluh enam.

58
00:01:13,943 --> 00:01:14,883
Tidak ada yang pernah terbukti

59
00:01:14,903 --> 00:01:15,436
bisa.

60
00:01:15,456 --> 00:01:17,603
Jadi satu byte kecil membatasi

61
00:01:17,623 --> 00:01:18,672
game sebesar Pac-Man.

62
00:01:18,692 --> 00:01:19,755
Kamu pernah main sampai level

63
00:01:19,775 --> 00:01:20,593
berapa?

